## Interface: 11509, 20504
## Title: Pockets
## Notes: Minimal, opinionated bag HUD with progressive disclosure, bag-full ETA, and automatic categorization (WoW Classic Anniversary, TBC-compatible)
## Author: Claude Code
## Version: 0.1.0
## SavedVariables: PocketsDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: PocketsCharDB

# Bootstrap (namespace + constants must load first)
Init.lua
Constants.lua

# WoW API Adapters (isolate direct Blizzard API access)
Adapters/BagAPI.lua
Adapters/ItemAPI.lua
Adapters/CombatAPI.lua
Adapters/TooltipAPI.lua
Adapters/BindingsAPI.lua

# NOTE: Bindings.xml is intentionally NOT listed here. WoW auto-discovers
# and parses a file literally named "Bindings.xml" in the addon's root
# directory using its dedicated keybinding-XML parser. Listing it in Files
# routes it through the generic UI-XML loader instead, which doesn't
# recognize the <Binding> element/attributes and throws
# "Unrecognized XML" errors.

# Domain services (no visible frames)
Core/EventBus.lua
Core/ItemCategorizer.lua
Core/RecentItems.lua
Core/CapacityEstimator.lua
Core/InventoryState.lua
Core/StackConsolidator.lua

# UI
UI/Layout.lua
UI/HoverGroup.lua
UI/ItemButtonPool.lua
UI/HUD.lua
UI/CategoryFlyout.lua
UI/ItemFlyout.lua
UI/Search.lua
UI/FullInventory.lua
UI/TooltipCounts.lua

# Cross-cutting event wiring + public API
Events.lua
API.lua

# Debug/test infrastructure
Debug.lua
Tests/TestRunner.lua
Tests/CategorizerTests.lua
Tests/RecentItemsTests.lua
Tests/CapacityEstimatorTests.lua
Tests/InventoryStateTests.lua
Tests/APITests.lua
